eaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"哼，那就試試看罷！拿我的兵刃來！","portrait":{"$m":524}},{"speaker":"禁軍刀","speaker_key":"face:19","side":1,"text":"統領大人，您是千金之體，不能就這樣出陣啊！要是您有了個萬一，誰來統率我們京城禁軍？","portrait":{"$m":525}},{"speaker":"韋勝","speaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"本統領身負守衛京師之責，如今讓敵人打到太和殿來，已是本軍的奇恥大辱了，當此時刻，若本統領不能身先士卒，光是在此畏縮不出，本軍弟兄們如何能服？又如何能對得起已不幸殉難的弟兄？拿我的兵刃來！","portrait":{"$m":524}},{"speaker":"禁軍刀","speaker_key":"face:19","side":1,"text":"統領大人，敵方是妖非人，請您再三思....","portrait":{"$m":526}},{"speaker":"上官遠","speaker_key":"face:4","side":1,"text":"他說的對，統領大人，這區區妖女，還不需勞您親自出馬！","portrait":{"$m":446}},{"speaker":"禁軍刀","speaker_key":"face:19","side":1,"text":"啊？！是上官都尉？","portrait":{"$m":526}},{"speaker":"上官遠","speaker_key":"face:4","side":1,"text":"下官夥同朋友一行，拜見韋統領。","portrait":{"$m":446}},{"speaker":"韋勝","speaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"啊，原來是上官都尉。這幾位是....","portrait":{"$m":527}},{"speaker":"上官遠","speaker_key":"face:4","side":1,"text":"啟稟統領大人，這幾位就是屬下向您提過的朋友，他們身負除妖絕技，屬下曾多次與他們一起迎戰妖魔，所向披靡，您眼前這個妖女也曾是他們的手下敗將。","portrait":{"$m":446}},{"speaker":"韋勝","speaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"哦！眾位英雄遠道而來，韋某有失遠迎，還請各位恕罪。","portrait":{"$m":527}},{"speaker":"殷劍平","speaker_key":"face:1","side":1,"text":"統領大人言重了。我們是受上官兄之邀前來幫忙，晚輩自當竭盡所能。這些禁軍士兵不具對付妖魔之能，是否能請統領命他們盡數撤回，如此既可免去無謂死傷，也有利晚輩一行殲妖滅魔。","portrait":{"$m":426}},{"speaker":"韋勝","speaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"現在廣場上殺成一團，要他們馬上撤回實有困難，得請你們入陣衝殺擋護一番，他們方能乘隙退回本陣。","portrait":{"$m":527}},{"speaker":"殷劍平","speaker_key":"face:1","side":1,"text":"統領大人所言極是，那晚輩就這麼辦了。請您下令槍陣讓開一條路，我們這就入陣參戰。","portrait":{"$m":426}},{"speaker":"韋勝","speaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"諸位英雄，你們若能除滅這些妖魔一行，韋某必定盡己所能，重重酬謝各位一番。","portrait":{"$m":527}},{"speaker":"殷劍平","speaker_key":"face:1","side":1,"text":"統領大人，我們除滅妖魔，為的是天下存亡、百姓安居，統領大人酬謝之意，晚輩只有心領了。","portrait":{"$m":434}},{"speaker":"韋勝","speaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"少俠氣度胸襟令韋某由衷欽佩，那麼一切就有勞諸位了....","portrait":{"$m":527}},{"speaker":"殷劍平","speaker_key":"face:1","side":1,"text":"韋統領不用客氣，這妖女就交給我們吧。諸位，我們上！","portrait":{"$m":427}},{"speaker":"韓無砂","speaker_key":"face:34","side":1,"text":"哼，又是你們！之前聽高戚和鄲老鬼說你們已經來到京城，沒想到咱們這麼快就見面了。","portrait":{"$m":458}},{"speaker":"封寒月","speaker_key":"face:2","side":1,"text":"上回在九曜之廳讓妳僥倖逃得一命，這回不會再放過妳了。韓無砂，妳乖乖的受死罷！","portrait":{"$m":439}},{"speaker":"韓無砂","speaker_key":"face:34","side":1,"text":"這句話才是我要說的。嘿嘿，原本不想多傷人命的，既然你們來了，看來我也不用手下留情了。通通給我殺了！","portrait":{"$m":459}},{"line":0,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,4],"layers":{"$":189},"units":{"$":190},"step":18,"base":"overview"}},[{"$":2},{"$":3},{"$":4},{"$":5},{"$":6},{"$":7},{"$":8},{"$":9},{"$":10}],[{"$":191},{"$":192},{"$":193},{"$":194},{"$":195},{"$":196},{"$":197},{"$":198},{"$":199},{"$":200},{"$":201},{"$":202},{"$":203},{"$":204},{"$":205},{"$":206},{"$":207},{"$":208},{"$":209},{"$":210},{"$":211},{"$":212},{"$":213},{"$":214},{"$":215},{"$":216},{"$":217},{"$":218},{"$":219},{"$":220},{"$":221},{"$":222},{"$":223},{"$":224},{"$":225},{"$":226},{"$":227},{"$":228},{"$":229},{"$":230},{"$":231},{"$":232},{"$":233},{"$":234},{"$":235},{"$":236},{"$":237},{"$":238},{"$":239},{"id":65,"visible":true,"group":1}],{"id":3,"visible":true,"group":1},{"id":5,"visible":true,"group":1},{"id":6,"visible":true,"group":1},{"id":7,"visible":true,"group":1},{"id":8,"visible":true,"group":1},{"id":10,"visible":false},{"id":11,"visible":false},{"id":12,"visible":false},{"id":13,"visible":false},{"id":14,"visible":false},{"id":15,"visible":false},{"id":16,"visible":false},{"id":17,"visible":false},{"id":18,"visible":false},{"id":19,"visible":false},{"id":20,"visible":false},{"id":21,"visible":false},{"id":22,"visible":false},{"id":23,"visible":false},{"id":24,"visible":false},{"id":25,"visible":false},{"id":26,"visible":false},{"id":27,"visible":false},{"id":28,"visible":false},{"id":29,"visible":false},{"id":30,"visible":false},{"id":31,"visible":false},{"id":32,"visible":false},{"id":33,"visible":false},{"id":34,"visible":false},{"id":35,"visible":false},{"id":36,"visible":false},{"id":37,"visible":false},{"id":38,"visible":false},{"id":39,"visible":false},{"id":40,"visible":false},{"id":41,"visible":false},{"id":42,"visible":false},{"id":43,"visible":false},{"id":44,"visible":false},{"id":45,"visible":false},{"id":46,"visible":false},{"id":47,"visible":false},{"id":48,"visible":false},{"id":49,"visible":false},{"id":50,"visible":false},{"id":51,"visible":false},{"id":52,"visible":false},{"id":53,"visible":false},{"line":1,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,4],"layers":{"$":189},"units":{"$":190},"step":19,"base":"overview"}},{"line":2,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,4],"layers":{"$":189},"units":{"$":190},"step":21,"base":"overview"}},{"line":3,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,4],"layers":{"$":189},"units":{"$":243},"step":24,"base":"overview"}},[{"$":191},{"$":192},{"$":193},{"$":194},{"$":195},{"$":196},{"$":197},{"$":198},{"$":199},{"$":200},{"$":201},{"$":202},{"$":203},{"$":204},{"$":205},{"$":206},{"$":207},{"$":208},{"$":209},{"$":210},{"$":211},{"$":212},{"$":213},{"$":214},{"$":215},{"$":216},{"$":217},{"$":218},{"$":219},{"$":220},{"$":221},{"$":222},{"$":223},{"$":224},{"$":225},{"$":226},{"$":227},{"$":228},{"$":229},{"$":230},{"$":231},{"$":232},{"$":233},{"$":234},{"$":235},{"$":236},{"$":237},{"$":238},{"$":239},{"$":244}],{"id":65,"visible":false,"group":1},{"line":4,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,4],"layers":{"$":189},"units":{"$":243},"step":25,"base":"overview"}},{"line":5,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,4],"layers":{"$":189},"units":{"$":243},"step":26,"base":"overview"}},{"visual_only":true,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,4],"layers":[{"$":2},{"$":3},{"$":4},{"$":5},{"$":6},{"$":7},{"$":8},{"$":9},{"$":81}],"units":{"$":248},"step":39,"base":"overview"}},[{"id":0,"x":12,"y":45,"visible":true,"group":1,"direction":1},{"id":1,"visible":false},{"id":2,"x":13,"y":44,"visible":true,"group":1,"direction":1},{"id":3,"visible":true,"group":1,"x":13,"y":46,"direction":1},{"id":4,"x":13,"y":47,"visible":true,"group":1,"direction":1},{"id":5,"visible":true,"group":1,"x":14,"y":44,"direction":1},{"id":6,"visible":true,"group":1,"x":13,"y":48,"direction":1},{"id":7,"visible":true,"group":1,"x":14,"y":45,"direction":1},{"id":8,"visible":true,"group":1,"x":14,"y":46,"direction":1},{"id":9,"x":14,"y":47,"visible":true,"group":1,"direction":1},{"$":196},{"$":197},{"$":198},{"$":199},{"$":200},{"$":201},{"$":202},{"$":203},{"$":204},{"$":205},{"$":206},{"$":207},{"$":208},{"$":209},{"$":210},{"$":211},{"$":212},{"$":213},{"$":214},{"$":215},{"$":216},{"$":217},{"$":218},{"$":219},{"$":220},{"$":221},{"$":222},{"$":223},{"$":224},{"$":225},{"$":226},{"$":227},{"$":228},{"$":229},{"$":230},{"$":231},{"$":232},{"$":233},{"$":234},{"$":235},{"$":236},{"$":237},{"$":238},{"$":239},{"$":244}],{"line":6,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,41],"layers":{"$":250},"units":{"$":248},"step":42,"base":"overview"}},[{"$":2},{"$":3},{"$":4},{"$":5},{"$":6},{"$":7},{"$":8},{"$":9},{"$":84}],{"line":7,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,41],"layers":{"$":250},"units":{"$":248},"step":43,"base":"overview"}},{"line":8,"scene":{"background":1,"camera":[7,41],"layers":{"$":250},"units":{"$":248},"step":44,"base":"overview"}},{"label":"戰鬥勝利：敵方全滅"},{"speaker":"韓無砂","speaker_key":"face:34","side":1,"text":"哼，你們且別得意，現在還沒分出勝負....齊祀的『玄陰搜魂陣』就快完成了，屆時不只是你們幾個，方圓數十里之內，任誰都得變成有軀無魂的活死人。","portrait":{"$m":459}},{"speaker":"封寒月","speaker_key":"face:2","side":1,"text":"這裡有禁軍壓陣，待會我們便請韋統領派兵拆了祭天塔，我倒看看那齊祀有多大本事。","portrait":{"$m":439}},{"speaker":"韓無砂","speaker_key":"face:34","side":1,"text":"嘿嘿嘿，且看你們能否動得了祭天塔。少陪了！","portrait":{"$m":457}},{"speaker":"殷劍平","speaker_key":"face:1","side":1,"text":"韓無砂！別逃......","portrait":{"$m":432}},{"speaker":"上官遠","speaker_key":"face:4","side":1,"text":"殷老弟，咱們不急著追，就算跑得了韓無砂，卻跑不了祭天塔。","portrait":{"$m":446}},{"speaker":"封寒月","speaker_key":"face:2","side":1,"text":"只怕韓無砂並非空言恫嚇，此刻已過丑時，正是陰氣最盛之時，我擔心那搜魂陣即將發動，殷大哥，我們還是快去祭天塔瞧瞧。","portrait":{"$m":435}},{"speaker":"殷劍平","speaker_key":"face:1","side":1,"text":"統領大人，此地之圍已解，請您派遣五十名兵士隨我們前往祭天塔，阻止齊祀完成那搜魂大陣。","portrait":{"$m":426}},{"speaker":"韋勝","speaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"五十名未免太過小氣。待會韋某也和你們同去，調動全城禁軍包圍祭天塔，絕不能讓那齊祀逃了。","portrait":{"$m":527}},{"speaker":"紫楓","speaker_key":"face:3","side":1,"text":"塔內只怕有妖魔到處橫行，韋統領您率軍在外掠陣即可，登塔之事由我們負責便是。","portrait":{"$m":478}},{"speaker":"韋勝","speaker_key":"face:20","side":0,"text":"好說，諸位請先休整片刻，待人馬調集妥當，咱們再一起前往祭天塔。請！","portrait":{"$m":527}}]}